## Компоненты — обязательные правила

### Структура SFC

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
// 1. Импорты
// 2. defineOptions / defineProps / defineEmits / defineModel / defineSlots
// 3. Composables (useRouter, useI18n, useStore, ...)
// 4. Ref / reactive / computed
// 5. Watch / watchEffect
// 6. Функции-обработчики
// 7. Lifecycle hooks (onMounted, onUnmounted, ...)
</script>

<template>
  <!-- HTML с BEM-классами -->
</template>

<style lang="scss" scoped>
// BEM-стили
</style>
```

### defineOptions — именование компонента

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
defineOptions({ name: 'TaskCard' })
</script>
```

### defineSlots — типизация слотов

```vue
<script setup lang="ts" generic="TItem">
defineSlots<{
  default(props: { item: TItem; index: number }): void
  header(): void
  empty(): void
}>()
</script>
```

### provide / inject с InjectionKey

```ts
// keys.ts
import type { InjectionKey, Ref } from 'vue'

export const THEME_KEY: InjectionKey<Ref<string>> = Symbol('theme')

// Provider.vue
import { provide, ref } from 'vue'
import { THEME_KEY } from './keys'

const theme = ref('light')
provide(THEME_KEY, theme)

// Consumer.vue
import { inject } from 'vue'
import { THEME_KEY } from './keys'

const theme = inject(THEME_KEY)
```

